\sum_{x} \textcolor[RGB]{0,191,196}{P_{x\mid 1} \ \hat\mu(1,x)} - \sum_{x} \textcolor[RGB]{248,118,109}{P_{x\mid 0} \  \hat\mu(0,x)}  \\
